    }
   ],
   "answer": "a",
   "hint": "Stored energy is released.",
   "explain": "Stored chemical energy becomes KE of the fragments."
  }
 ],
 "takeaways": [
  "Momentum: always conserved in a closed system.",
  "KE: same (elastic), less (inelastic), more (explosion)."
 ]
